{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2023-02-09 13:05:00', 'title': 'THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY ANNOUNCES STRATEGIC RESTRUCTURING, RESTORING ACCOUNTABILITY TO CREATIVE BUSINESSES', 'text': "BURBANK, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY ANNOUNCED DETAILS OF ITS STRATEGIC RESTRUCTURING THAT WILL REFOCUS THE ORGANIZATION ON CREATIVITY, EMPOWER CREATIVE LEADERS AND ENSURE THEY ARE ACCOUNTABLE FOR ALL ASPECTS OF THEIR BUSINESSES GLOBALLY, AND PUT THE COMPANY'S STREAMING BUSINESS ON A PATH TO SUSTAINED GROWTH AND PROFITABILITY."}{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2023-02-09 12:18:00', 'title': 'STATEMENT FROM THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY', 'text': "BURBANK, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY (NYSE: DIS) BOARD OF DIRECTORS ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT TODAY IN RESPONSE TO NELSON PELTZ'S ANNOUNCEMENT THAT TRIAN FUND IS NO LONGER PURSUING A PROXY CONTEST AT DISNEY: “WE RESPECT AND VALUE THE INPUT OF ALL OUR SHAREHOLDERS AND WE APPRECIATE THE DECISION BY TRIAN FUND ANNOUNCED BY NELSON PELTZ THIS MORNING."}{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2023-02-09 11:31:00', 'title': 'TRIAN APPLAUDS RECENT INITIATIVES ANNOUNCED BY DISNEY AS A WIN FOR ALL SHAREHOLDERS AND CONCLUDES PROXY CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TRIAN FUND MANAGEMENT, L.P. (“TRIAN”), WHOSE INVESTMENT FUNDS COLLECTIVELY OWN APPROXIMATELY 9.4 MILLION COMMON SHARES OF THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY (NYSE: DIS) (“DISNEY” OR THE “COMPANY”) VALUED AT APPROXIMATELY $1 BILLIONI, TODAY ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT: “WE CONGRATULATE DISNEY AND BOB IGER ON THEIR RECENTLY ANNOUNCED OPERATING INITIATIVES, WHICH ARE A WIN FOR ALL SHAREHOLDERS AND BROADLY ALIGN WITH OUR THINKING.'}